  <para style="h">2 Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete rya kabiri Pawulo yandikiye Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete rya kabiri Pawulo yandikiye</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Jewe Pawulo, intumwa ya Yesu Kristo, natoranijwe mu kugomba kw’Imana, ndabihawe n’isezerano ry’ubuzima riri muri Kristo Yesu,<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Ndakwandikiye mwana wanje nkunda Timoteyo:</para>
  <para style="po" vid="2TI 1:2">Ubuntu, imbabazi n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data no ku Mwami wacu Kristo Yesu bibane na we.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ashima Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Ndashima Imana nkorera n’umutima wanje wose nk’uko ba sogokuruza bayikorera. Nama nkwibuka iyo nsenze ijoro n’umutaga. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Nama nibuka amarira yawe igihe twatandukana, bikantera kwipfuza gusubira kukubona kugira ngo nuzure umunezero. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Nama nibuka ukwizera kwawe kwabanje kuba muri nyokuru wawe Lowisi no muri nyoko Ewunise, ubu naho kukaba kubandanya kuba muri wewe.<verse eid="2TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ahanura Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ni co gituma ndakwibutsa kwongera kwatsa ingabire Imana yaguhaye igihe nakurambikako ibiganza. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Kuko Imana itaduhaye Mpwemu w’ubwoba, ariko yaduhaye Mpwemu w’ububasha, w’urukundo kandi wo kuganza ingeso zacu. <verse eid="2TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Nuko rero ntukagire isoni zo gushingira intahe Umwami wacu, kandi ntuterwe isoni nanje imbohe yiwe. Ahubwo ku bw’inkomezi wahawe n’Imana, wemere ubabazanywe nanje ku bw’Ubutumwa Bwiza. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Kuko Imana ni yo yadukijije, iduhamagarira kubaho ubuzima bwejejwe. Ivyo ntiyabikoze kuko twari tubibereye, ariko ni ku bw’umugambi wayo n’ubuntu bwayo. Ubwo buntu twabuherewe muri Kristo Yesu ibihe bitarabaho, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />ariko buhishurwa mu kuza kw’umukiza wacu Kristo Yesu, uwasambuye rwose ububasha bw’urupfu, agashira ahabona ubuzima n’ukudapfa biciye mu Butumwa Bwiza. <verse eid="2TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Kandi Imana yantoranirije kuba umuvuzi w’ubwo Butumwa Bwiza, nk’intumwa n’umwigisha. <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />Ni co gituma ndiko ndababazwa uku. Ariko singira isoni kuko ndazi uwo nizeye, kandi sinkekeranya ko ashoboye kuzigama ico namubikije gushika ku musi w’ukugaruka kwiwe.<verse eid="2TI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Wame ufatira akarorero ku nyigisho z’ukuri wanyumvanye, uhagarare mu kwizera, no mu rukundo dufise muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Uzigame ingabire nziza wabikijwe, ufashijwe n’ububasha bwa Mpwemu Yera aba muri twebwe.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abataye Pawulo n’abamugumyeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Urazi ko abo muri Aziya bose bantaye, harimwo Figelusi na Heremogeni.<verse eid="2TI 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Ariko Imana igirire ubuntu abo mu nzu kwa Onesiforo, kuko yangendeye kenshi akandemesha. Ntiyigeze aterwa isoni n’uko ndi mw’ibohero. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Igihe yaza i Roma, yarandondeye hose gushika antoye. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Umwami Imana amuhe kuzobona ubuntu buva kuri Kristo ku musi azogarukirako. Murazi ingene yamfashije mu buryo bwinshi igihe nari muri Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo asubira guhanura Timoteyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />None rero na we, mwana wanje, ugirire inkomezi mu buntu turonkera muri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Kandi ivyo wanyumvanye hari ivyabona vyinshi, uzovyigishe abantu b’ukwizerwa, na bo bazoshobora kuvyigisha abandi. <verse eid="2TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Wifatanye nanje mu kwihanganira imibabaro, nk’umusoda mwiza wa Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Nta wahawe kuba umusoda abandanya yivanga mu vy’ubuzima busanzwe ashobora guhimbara umukuru wiwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Ni co kimwe n’umunonotsi, ntashobora koronka agashimwe kiretse yahiganywe akurikije amategeko. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Uwaruhiye kw’isuka ni we yari akwiye kuba uwa mbere mu kurya ivyeze vyo mu mwimbu wiwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Ufate akanya wiyumvire ku vyo ndiko ndakubarira, Umwami Imana azoguha gutahura muri vyose.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Wame wibuka Yesu Kristo yazutse mu bapfuye, yavuye mu muryango wa Dawidi, nk’uko Ubutumwa nahawe buvuga. Ubwo ni bwo mbabarizwa, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />gushika n’aho mbohwa nk’umwicanyi. Ariko ijambo ry’Imana ryo ntiriboshwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Ni co gituma nihanganira vyose ku bw’abatoranijwe, kugira ngo na bo baronke agakiza kari muri Kristo Yesu, hamwe n’ubwiza butazoshira.<verse eid="2TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Iri jambo ni iryo kwizera:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Nitwapfana na we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">tuzobana bazima na we.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Nitwihangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">tuzoganzanya na we.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Nitwamwihakana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">na we azotwihakana.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Naho tutoba abizigirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">we aguma ari umwizigirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">kuko ntashobora kwivuguruza.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’abigisha b’ibinyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Ibi uzokwame ivyibutsa abantu, ubihanikiriza mu nyonga z’Imana ngo bareke guharira ivyerekeye amajambo, kuko ata kimazi bifise, kandi bishobora kugwisha abavyumva. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Ukore ibishoboka vyose kugira ngo wame ugaragara wemewe imbere y’Imana, umukozi anezererwa igikorwa ciwe, kandi asigura neza ijambo ry’ukuri. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Wirinde ibiyago vy’ubupfu, kuko abavyamamwo bibatwara mu kutubaha Imana. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Inyigisho zabo zikwiragira nk’ingwara ya kanseri mu mubiri. Muri bo harimwo Humenayo na Fileto. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Bataye inzira y’ukuri, bigisha ko izuka ry’abapfuye ryamaze kuba, maze bagasambura ukwizera kwa bamwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Ariko, imfatiro zikomeye zashizweho n’Imana zirashimangiye. Zanditsweko aya majambo ngo: “Uhoraho arazi abiwe”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Guharura 16:5</ref></char></char></note>; kandi ngo: “Abatura izina ry’Uhoraho bose bave mu kugabitanya.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mu nzu nini itunze, ntihabamwo gusa ibikoresho bikozwe mu nzahabu canke mw’ifeza gusa, habamwo n’ibikozwe mu biti, no mw’ibumba. Kandi bimwe vyagenewe gukoreshwa ivy’icubahiro, ibindi na vyo vyagenwe gukoreshwa ibikorwa bisanzwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Umuntu niyiyeza, azoba igikoresho c’icubahiro, cejejwe, kigirira akamaro nyene co, kandi giteguriwe gukora igikora ciza cose.<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Uhunge ivyipfuzo bibi vy’ubusore, urondere ukugororoka, ukwizera, urukundo n’amahoro, wifatanye n’abambaza Umwami Imana n’imitima itanduye. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Wirinde ibihari vy’ubupfu ata kindi bishikanako atari imitongano. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Kandi umukozi w’Imana ntakwiye kuba mu mitongano, ahubwo agira ubugwaneza kuri bose, akaba ushoboye kwigisha, no kwihanganira abanyabihari. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Abamugwanya abigishanya ubugwaneza, yizigiye ko Imana ishobora kubaha ukwihana no kubashikana ku kumenya ukuri, <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />maze bakabona kwisubirako, bakava mu mutego wa Satani, yabagize imbohe zo gukora ivyo ashaka vyose.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Umenye neza ibi: mu misi ya nyuma hazoba ibihe bigoye. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Abantu bazokwikunda, bakunde amahera, birate ivyabo, buzure ubwishime. Bazotuka Imana bongere bagararize abavyeyi babo, babe intashima, ntibubahe ikintu na kimwe cejejwe. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Urukundo rwabo ruzotimba, ntibazoshobora guharira, bazovuga nabi, bananirwe kuganza ingeso zabo, bazoba bateye ubwoba, banka iciza cose. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Bazoba buzuye ubuhemu, batazi kugenza buhoro, buzuye ukwishira hejuru, bakunda ibibanezereza bakabirutisha Imana. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Bazoba bigira abagororotsi ariko bahakana aho ubushobozi bwo kugororoka buva. Uze wame witandukanye n’abantu nk’abo.<verse eid="2TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Bamwe muri bo banyengetera mu mazu bagahenda abagore b’abanyantegenke baremerewe n’ivyaha, baganzwa n’ivyipfuzo vyabo, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />bama bakurikira inyigisho nshasha zose, ariko batigera bashika ku kumenya ukuri. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Nk’uko Yane na Yambure bagwanije Mose, ni ko n’abo bantu bagwanya ukuri. Ubwenge bwabo bwarononekaye, kandi mu kwizera kwabo barazimiye. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ariko nta ho bazoshika, kuko nk’uko vyagenze kuri Yane na Yambure ubupfu bwabo umusi umwe buzoja ahabona.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Impanuro za nyuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Ariko wewe urazi ivyo nigisha n’ukuntu nigenza, n’igituma nkora ivyo nkora. Urazi ukwizera kwanje n’ukwihangana kwanje, urukundo rwanje n’ugushikama kwanje. <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />Urazi uguhamwa n’imibabaro naciyemwo. Urazi ingene nahamwe ndi muri Antiyokiya, Ikoniyo n’i Lusitira. Ariko aho hose Umwami Imana yagiye arankiza. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Mu vy’ukuri, umuntu wese ahisemwo kugira ubuzima bugororotse muri Kristo Yesu azotegerezwa guhamwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Ariko abanyakibi bazoshishikara kuja kure mu bibi vyabo. Bazokomeza kuzimira kandi bazozimiza benshi. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Ariko weho, wumire ku vyo wigishijwe ukavyakira. Urazi ko ari ivy’ukuri, kandi urazi uwabikwigishije. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Kandi kuva mu bwana bwawe, waramenye Ivyanditswe Vyera, na vyo biguha kugira ubwenge bwo kwakira agakiza kabonerwa mu kwizera Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Ivyanditswe vyose vyahumetswe n’Imana kandi bifise akamaro ko kwigisha ukuri, kwiyamiriza ibibi, gukebura no gutoza indero nziza mu bugororotsi, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />kugira ngo umuntu w’Imana atunganywe rwose, agire ibikwiye ku bw’igikorwa ciza cose.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ndakwingingiye mu nyonga z’Imana n’imbere ya Kristo Yesu, azocira urubanza abazima n’abapfuye aho azozira kwima ku ngoma yiwe: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />wigishe Ijambo ry’Imana. Wame witeguye mu gihe kibereye n’ikitabereye; wemeze abantu ukuri, wihanize abari mu bibi, ubatere intege mu kubigisha neza, ugire ukwihangana kwinshi. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Kuko mu gihe kigiye kuza abantu ntibazoba bacemera inyigisho z’ukuri. Ahubwo bazokwirundaniriza abigisha bababwira ivyo amatwi yabo yipfuza kwumva gusa. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Bazokwanka kwumva ukuri, bahindukirire imigani. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Ariko weho, ugire ubwenge mu bihe vyose, wihanganire ibikubabaza, ukore igikorwa c’umuvuzi w’Ubutumwa Bwiza, ushitse igikorwa cose Imana yaguhamagariye.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Nayo jewe, ndi hafi yo gutanga ubuzima bwanje ngo busukwe nk’ishikanwa ry’ikinyobwa; igihe canje co kugenda kiri hafi. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Nagwanye intambara nziza, ndarangije urugendo, nazigamye ukwizera. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Ubu ndindiriye urugori rwo kugororoka, urwo Umwami Imana, we mucamanza agororotse, azompa kuri urya musi. Kandi ntazoruha jewe jenyene, azoruha n’abarindiranye igishika uguhishurwa kwiwe.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gusozera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Gerageza uzoze kundaba vuba, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />kuko Dema yarantaye aja i Tesalonike, kuko akunze ivy’iyi si. Kiresensi yagiye i Galatiya, Tito na we yagiye i Dalumatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka wenyene ni we turi kumwe. Uzohitane Mariko muzanane, kuko yambereye uw’ikimazi kinini mu gikorwa canje. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Tukiko namurungitse muri Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Niwaza uzonzanire ikoti y’imbeho nasize kwa Karupo i Tirowa, n’ibitabu vyanje, na canecane ivy’imizingo.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alegizandere umucuzi yarambabaje cane. Umwami Imana amwishure ibihwanye n’ivyo yankoreye. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Kandi na wewe umwirinde kuko yaragwanije cane ivyo twigisha.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Igihe naja kuburana ubwa mbere, nta n’umwe yanshigikiye, bose barantaye. Ntibaze babiharurweko. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ariko Umwami Imana yabaye ku ruhande rwanje, ampa inkomezi, kugira ngo mvuge Ubutumwa Bwiza bwuzuye, Abanyamahanga bose babwumve. Kandi Umwami Imana yankuye mu menyo y’intambwe. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Umwami Imana azonkiza ibitero vy’umwansi vyose, kandi azontahukana amahoro mu bwami bwiwe bwo mw’ijuru. Icubahiro kibe iciwe ibihe vyose, Amen.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Intasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Untahirize Pirisila na Akwilasi, n’abo mu muryango wa Onesiforo.<verse eid="2TI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Erasito yasigaye i Korinto, kandi nasize Tirofimo agwariye i Mileto. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Wigore uzoshike hano imbere y’igihe c’imbeho nyinshi cane.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TI 4:21" />
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Yeburusi, Pudensi, Linusi, Korodiya hamwe n’abandi bene Data bose barabaramutsa.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Umwami Imana abane n’impwemu yawe, kandi ubuntu bwiwe bubane namwe mwese.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>